{"chroma:document":"Changes Over Time:\n- c. 528 BCE: Buddha’s first sermon.\n- c. 250 BCE: Ashoka builds monuments.\n- 5th century CE: Dhamek Stupa constructed.\n- 12th century: Decline.\n- 1794/1835: Modern rediscovery and excavation.\n- 1905: Sarnath Museum opened.\n\nKey Events:\n- c. 528 BCE: First Sermon.\n- c. 250 BCE: Ashokan construction.\n- 1905: Museum opened.","source":"sarnath.txt"}